WEBVTT

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:38.220
No!

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:49.480
Dranzer...

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:52.280
Hang in there with
me for a little longer.

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:56.920
Until we defeat him.
To the ends of my life.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.360
Just a little longer...

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.500
I see.

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.660
I'll fight you for as
long as you want.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.960
Here I come, Brooklyn!

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.740
Until my life burns out!

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:29.930
Kai!!

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.890
Kai manages to turn it around!

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:04.210
He countered Brooklyn's attack!

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:05.240
Kai!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:07.220
Go for it, Kai!

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.890
Whoopsie! Brooklyn is...

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:14.580
What's going on, Garland?
I hope he isn't toying with him again.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:20.540
He's not. Kai Hiwatari has brought out
a similar kind of passion in Brooklyn.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.240
Similar?

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:28.350
Kai might regret getting
back up so quickly, though.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:35.580
That attack wasn't half bad.

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:36.770
Even so...

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:45.330
It should be a little more like this.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.240
Kai stood his ground!

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:55.520
He's going back on the attack!

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.100
You've got good power. And yet...

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:13.930
I'm glad you're capable of fighting like this.

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:15.220
Well?

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.050
Kai...

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:24.580
Kai is attacking with everything he's got, but it's not working on Brooklyn!

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:28.740
He's strong, but I almost
wonder if this is too cruel?

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:32.450
I'm worried about what
the fans will think.

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:44.640
Kai doesn't stand a chance!

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:50.130
Is it truly impossible to defy
the script a god has written?!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:53.580
Brooklyn is kinda
scary, isn't he?

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:56.920
So much more so than earlier...

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.440
It's only natural.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:05.170
Despite being perfect and
all-seeing, he isn't satisfied.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:10.220
He is a bottomless pit that
can consume everything.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:18.880
Kai's own talent has
opened the forbidden door.

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:27.180
Dranzer...

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:31.640
Hang in there for me.
Just a little longer.

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:35.560
Dranzer can't take
any more damage.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:38.820
It's only a matter of time
before it breaks into pieces.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.410
Which means...

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:44.640
Kyoujyu!

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:48.970
Rei!

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:50.440
Sensei?!

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:51.330
Don't stop us.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:55.450
Sorry. But I can't watch this anymore!

00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:59.570
Don't stop us, Takao!

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:02.000
Kai's fought enough!

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:05.060
Are you okay with this?

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:08.040
Are you okay with
what's happening to Kai?!

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:10.930
Takao! Say something!

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:14.450
Takao! What are you...

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:22.050
Takao...

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:26.520
There's no way I'd
ever be okay with it...

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:30.740
But I made a promise.
A promise with Kai!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:34.700
I could never face him
again if I stopped him!

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:38.760
So don't force me
to break my promise.

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:40.480
Please!

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:42.840
Rei! Max!

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:47.340
I'm sorry, Takao.

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:52.690
Our pain doesn't
even compare.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:55.620
We'll believe in him.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.700
In Kai's battle!

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:00.490
Kai! Don't lose to him!

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.200
Kai!!

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.860
Kai fell but he's still in!

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:18.140
But is he only delaying
his inevitable defeat?!

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:20.050
Let's wrap this up.

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:25.340
You did good.

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:27.800
I've never felt this way before.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.160
This was a part of my
vision too, though.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:34.320
Kai! Get up! Please!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:36.300
Kai!!

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:40.280
If I'm honest, I envy you.

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:44.380
To be able to get so
heated over a top battle.

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.500
Brooklyn!!

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:54.500
Sorry. Did I hit a nerve?

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.770
I'm not making fun of you.

00:07:56.770 --> 00:08:00.700
But I am invincible.
You know that, right?

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:19.430
Farewell.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.970
King of Darkness.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.300
Kai...!

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:00.420
It's over!!

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:07.620
It's finally over! Brooklyn
wins the Justice 5!

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:12.700
Dangit!

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.010
Kai...

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.180
Wait!

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:30.100
Impossible...

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:42.760
It's not over!

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:46.580
Kai is still up!
The battle is on!

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:57.690
Why would you get back up? You don't have the strength to attack.

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:58.800
Come at me.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:02.680
I wouldn't advise it.
My visions have not changed.

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:04.610
I said come at me!

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:06.650
Oh, goodness...

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:20.640
You should know better.

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:24.890
Shut your mouth.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.680
It's still not over!

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:37.530
Impossible...

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:39.680
Come at me...

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:43.560
You don't know when to quit!

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:53.240
I was in such a good mood, too.

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:55.050
You ruined it!

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.980
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:21.950
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:29.090
Kai has stood back up again!

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:32.120
Why? Why do you
get back up?

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:35.090
You know you
can't win. So why?

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:40.360
What is this?

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:44.720
Sweat?
I'm sweating? Me?

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:47.880
This wasn't a
part of my vision!

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:58.220
Bastard!

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:02.200
I told you to give it up!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.520
So why won't you stay down?!

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:07.020
Why?!

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:09.380
What's happening to Brooklyn?

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:13.700
Kai Hiwatari shouldn't
have any strength left.

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:18.420
No. Kai still has one thing left.

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:21.600
It's not a special move
or some power.

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:24.220
It's something more
important than all of that.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.170
More important?

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:40.160
What about now?!

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:08.810
Is this a dream?

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:13.740
Even after taking all that damage,
he rises again like a phoenix!

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:15.970
It's twist after twist!

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:19.190
What will the result
of this match be?!

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:25.540
I can't see my visions... I don't know what's going to happen!

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:27.850
I don't know...

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:30.480
Just who is this guy?

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.540
What's wrong with him?

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:39.980
Here I come!

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.620
Zeus!!!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:56.100
Stay back! Stay back!

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.880
Stay back!

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:00.540
What's gotten into
you, Brooklyn?!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.010
Stay back!!

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:09.840
I hate you!
You cannot be allowed to live!

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:14.760
You must disappear! Begone!

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:21.610
Kai! You can do it! Kai!!

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:30.090
No...

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:38.050
How? How are
you still standing?

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:41.860
Even after all of my attacks...

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.840
Listen up, Brooklyn!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.940
You are a true genius.

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:55.050
You can reach further heights
without having to work hard for it.

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:59.120
It doesn't matter what kind of
special move or strategy I have...

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:02.650
You're so talented I
could never compare.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:06.100
However, I still have
something you lack!

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:07.840
Lack...?

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.420
I have...

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:15.740
I have all of the days
leading up to now!

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:17.890
Countless battles.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.730
Victories. Defeats.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.650
Enemies. Friends.

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:27.260
The sweat I've shed. Countless bruises!

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:31.240
Rage. Grief. Joy.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:35.500
I have all of the days I
put myself on the line for!

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:38.860
Passionate, relentless...

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:41.200
Wonderful days!

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:46.200
It's what you lack.
But gives me strength!

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:49.740
I don't understand.
You make no sense!

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:51.620
I don't understand!

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:55.970
You wouldn't.
Because you are not a Blader.

00:15:56.460 --> 00:16:00.380
Every Blader has a passionate heart that beats within them.

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:02.620
You don't have a Beyspirit!

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:05.160
Bey...spirit?

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:08.450
You have no
love for Beyblade.

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:12.170
You act like a god, closed off
in your own little world!

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:14.620
I would never lose to you!

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:21.580
Take this! This is my love!!

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:46.730
It's over!!

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:50.110
Kai Hiwatari makes
a huge comeback!

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.920
Awright!

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:55.330
We finally won!
Our first win!

00:16:55.330 --> 00:17:01.320
Impossible...
He should not have lost to Kai Hiwatari!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:06.610
They got their first win off of
BEGA's secret weapon, Brooklyn!

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:10.770
Kai has gotten his revenge
from the BEGA qualifiers!

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:16.010
Listen to this storm of
cheers and applause for Kai!

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.550
Congratulations!

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.980
That was excellent, Kai!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:23.220
Really great!

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:26.560
You big jerk! That was so cool!

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:30.020
Kai!
You are something else!

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.380
You're amazing!

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:37.320
Dozens, or even hundreds of times more amazing than I thought!

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:41.330
Kai Hiwatari, you're the best!

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:43.400
No way!

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:45.920
Brooklyn lost?

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:50.000
Calm down.
Everyone loses.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.780
This is the
world of competition.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:59.120
Do you understand, Brooklyn?
This is the world you never knew.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:03.300
You've taken your first step into the unknown world of defeat.

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:05.170
And now you will change.

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:07.970
Like a butterfly on the
verge of reawakening.

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:11.600
This is the start
of a new you.

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:16.650
Kai!!

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:34.000
Hey! Kai!
What's wrong?

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.520
Are you okay, Kai?

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:36.960
Stay with us, Kai!

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:38.770
Need a doctor?

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.560
Kai! What's wrong, Kai?!

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:43.480
What's all the fuss about?

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:45.260
Kai...

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:48.460
Are you really okay?

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:52.940
Don't worry about it.
I'm more worried about you.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:56.020
Look who's talkin'!

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:58.250
I'll win my match
in no time flat!

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:00.640
And then the two
of us will battle!

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:03.860
I'm gonna kick your butt,
so I hope you're ready!

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:12.170
Got it? That's a promise!

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:18.880
Kai. I won't
waste your victory.

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:24.480
I swear on the blood and sweat
you shed in that stadium.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:32.020
I will win! And stop BEGA and
Volkov's plans in their tracks!

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.370
Count on it!

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:36.170
Bring it, Takao Kinomiya.

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:40.820
I will defeat you on
the ultimate stage!

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:46.290
My name is a star that will shine for eternity
in the history books of Beyblading!

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:33.640
Beybattles are...
Incredible...

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:39.000
They're worth sacrificing
everything for.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.840
Don't you agree?

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:45.080
Right, Kinomiya?

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:58.000
Watch me, Kai!

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:02.190
I won't waste the victory you
risked your life to get!

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:04.040
Let's battle, Garland!

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:07.280
Takao Kinomiya, you are
the perfect opponent.

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:11.480
But know this. Defeat is not allowed for those of the Siebald family!

00:23:11.480 --> 00:23:15.130
For that is the path laid
out before us by the gods.

00:23:18.170 --> 00:23:22.830
See for yourself the power and traditions of my noble family!
